# Craft: world builds, renders continuously (fps from real panel pushes),
# touch look + mine don't crash, side button quits; Xbox Pad screen comes up.
wake
goto AppList
wait 300
goto Craft
expect screen Craft
expect log CRAFT: enter 5000
wait 3000
expect fps 8
snap play
drag 200 140 140 140 500
wait 300
tap 160 100
wait 600
expect screen Craft
expect noerr
snap after
btn short
wait 600
expect screen AppList
goto Pad
expect screen Pad
wait 2000
snap pad
expect noerr
